  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">안녕하세요!! 센서 가이드북 고등버전 제작 완료하고<br>돌아왔습니다ㅎㅎ!!<br>오늘 소개드릴 실험은 빛의 편광 관련 실험입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67b24757922b1ef59902246391914586dcfef210\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67b24757922b1ef59902246391914586dcfef210\" data-origin-width=\"1076\" data-origin-height=\"1239\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래 한 번 보시죠!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06b75f3ebf87f2d9043fd407e7ec450944e83761\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06b75f3ebf87f2d9043fd407e7ec450944e83761\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1471\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">각도 자체를 검정 종이+밝기 센서+LED를 활용해서<br>자동으로 측정할 수 있게 했습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/889f083b99aca0e23f3d9da711a0d36346232416\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/889f083b99aca0e23f3d9da711a0d36346232416\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1486\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">편광 필름 2개를 통과하여 나오는 빛은<br>첫번째 밝기 센서에서 측정하고,<br>각도는 간접적으로 두번째 밝기센서에서 측정합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8d2d5f9ffa36b2252c94224e53fadd1053ccb30\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8d2d5f9ffa36b2252c94224e53fadd1053ccb30\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1485\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/367dac7010eb97ff129782e16cfc4b99fca29a8a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/367dac7010eb97ff129782e16cfc4b99fca29a8a\" data-origin-width=\"1048\" data-origin-height=\"521\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">실제로 편광 필름만 보면 이런 느낌입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv9isy1cuk50wv39afcockhx9@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1440\" data-video-height=\"1440\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv9isy1cuk50wv39afcockhx9/thumbs/6.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33334811689&amp;signature=pfriuJKCwz68wWoA9tXQ0rO6Qdg%3D&amp;ts=1777902889\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1440\" data-video-origin-height=\"1440\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv9isy1cuk50wv39afcockhx9?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2OWlzeTFjdWs1MHd2MzlhZmNvY2toeDkiLCJ0aWQiOiJkZDgzMzYyNC01MzZiLTQxMGQtOTE1Ni00MDFhNWRjNWJiZDUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc5ODZ9.YFndX-H0Qks2QpUQZfrazSGblJb-347AHksSLcPCKZSPKCD8ujb1NQRDWKjgzeKG7c_SKhKFFYFC404fTDjTNQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래 빨간 그래프가 편광 필름 2개 통과한 빛<br>파란 그래프가 각도를 추정할 수 있는 <br>밝기 센서 값 입니다.<br>(10도 간격으로 검정 종이가 LED 빛을 가립니다)<br>(+) 좀 더 확대한 사진 아래 붙혔습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/141162fa4016898d310aacb87ca68350efd21cda\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/141162fa4016898d310aacb87ca68350efd21cda\" data-origin-width=\"876\" data-origin-height=\"1017\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/975fabe097b6a207f6dc619a4c3ac696e1fcc902\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/975fabe097b6a207f6dc619a4c3ac696e1fcc902\" data-origin-width=\"820\" data-origin-height=\"311\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">다른 고등부 실험책 가이드북 내용은<br>블로그 (#92)번 글에 올렸습니다!<br>(다운로드 링크도 있습니다ㅎㅎ!)<br><br>많이 보러오세용~~!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bOAWwe/dJMb8957oDs/siS7XBKzdIqnWMOkZ3LvLK/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bOAWwe/dJMb8957oDs/siS7XBKzdIqnWMOkZ3LvLK/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.co